msgid "**Break-glass access:** with SSO on and ``native`` off, the local administrator of ```tasks/05_administrator.yml`` <./tasks/05_administrator.yml>`__ has no form. Recovery runs through the CLI in the Mastodon container (``bin/tootctl accounts modify <user> --reset-password``, ``bin/tootctl settings``), and overriding ``services.mastodon.login.method.native.enabled: true`` in the inventory sets ``OMNIAUTH_ONLY=false``, after which the administrator signs in at ``/auth/sign_in`` with its e-mail and password."
