# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Deploy iteration.** [deploy/cli.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/deploy/cli.py) re-derives the same plan via `plan_dev_inventory_matrix` (the planner is a pure function shared between init and deploy) and runs one deploy per folder. **Every round deploys its full variant-aware include set.** Round R starts from a clean host (the previous round's include is purged before round R begins, see point 5), so every dep that round R needs MUST be redeployed."
msgstr "**Deploy Iteration.** [deploy/cli.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/deploy/cli.py) leitet den gleichen Plan über `plan_dev_inventory_matrix` (Der Planer ist eine reine Funktion, die zwischen init und Deployment geteilt wird) und führt einen Deploy pro Ordner aus. **Jede Runde stellt ihr vollständiges variantenbewusstes Inklusionsset bereit.** Runde R beginnt mit einem sauberen Host (das Einbeziehen der vorherigen Runde wird gespült, bevor Runde R beginnt, siehe Punkt 5), so dass jeder Punkt, den Runde R benötigt, neu zugewiesen werden MUSS."

msgid "**Deploy mode**: `mode=update` wherever `reinstall` is not required."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Deploy on an Encrypted Server** You SHOULD install Infinito.Nexus on an encrypted server to prevent hosting providers from accessing end-user data. For a practical guide on setting up an encrypted server, refer to the [Hetzner Arch LUKS repository](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/hetzner-arch-luks) 🔐. (Learn more about [disk encryption](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Disk_encryption) on Wikipedia.)"
msgstr "**Bereitstellen auf einem verschlüsselten Server** Sie sollten installieren Infinito.Nexus auf einem verschlüsselten Server, um Hosting-Provider am Zugriff auf Endnutzerdaten zu hindern. Eine praktische Anleitung zum Einrichten eines verschlüsselten Servers finden Sie unter [Hetzner Arch LUKS-Repository](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/hetzner-arch-luks) 🔐. (Erfahren Sie mehr über [Disk-Verschlüsselung](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Disk_encryption) auf Wikipedia.)"

msgid "**Deploy project:** The deploy converges a second project, `Infinito.Nexus Deploy`, next to `Infinito.Nexus`. It holds the template `deploy`, the inventory `deploy` carrying the deploy key, the repository `inventory` and an environment named `deploy <digest>`. The hook grants every Semaphore admin, whose flag it keeps in step with the `administrator` role group, the project role `owner` in it and revokes every other membership, so `operator` and `user` members neither see the project nor run its template."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Deploy project:** The deploy converges a second project, ``Infinito.Nexus Deploy``, next to ``Infinito.Nexus``. It holds the template ``deploy``, the inventory ``deploy`` carrying the deploy key, the repository ``inventory`` and an environment named ``deploy <digest>``. The hook grants every Semaphore admin, whose flag it keeps in step with the ``administrator`` role group, the project role ``owner`` in it and revokes every other membership, so ``operator`` and ``user`` members neither see the project nor run its template."
msgstr ""

