msgstr "**Einfache CSP-Integration** Berechnet und fügt automatisch einen CSP-Hash-Eintrag für Ihr Skript hinzu, sodass Sie die Inhaltssicherheitsrichtlinie sperren können, ohne einen Finger zu heben."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Easy CSP Integration**   Calculates a CSP hash for the injected script so you can safely allow it via your Content Security Policy."
msgstr "**Einfache CSP-Integration** Berechnet einen CSP-Hash für das injizierte Skript, damit Sie es über Ihre Content Security Policy sicher zulassen können."

msgid "**Editor Privilege Check:** `SHOPWARE_ACL_EDITOR_PRIVILEGES` is the expansion of the `product`, `category`, `media` and `cms` permission keys, which the administration computes in JavaScript only (`getPrivilegesForAdminPrivilegeKeys` in `app/service/privileges.service.ts`). [`files/playwright/test-rbac.js`](./files/playwright/test-rbac.js) expands the keys of the deployed `Editor` role in the signed-in administration and fails with the missing privileges when a Shopware version grants more than the list."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Editor Privilege Check:** ``SHOPWARE_ACL_EDITOR_PRIVILEGES`` is the expansion of the ``product``, ``category``, ``media`` and ``cms`` permission keys, which the administration computes in JavaScript only (``getPrivilegesForAdminPrivilegeKeys`` in ``app/service/privileges.service.ts``). ```files/playwright/test-rbac.js`` <./files/playwright/test-rbac.js>`__ expands the keys of the deployed ``Editor`` role in the signed-in administration and fails with the missing privileges when a Shopware version grants more than the list."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Effective networks of a role.** The node preset intersected with the role's `reachability.modes`, then reduced to one network when `single_mode` is set: `tor` if the node runs Tor, `clearnet` otherwise. An empty result fails the deploy."
msgstr ""

