# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Office Integration:** Import, export, and collaborate on Office documents (Word, Excel, PDF)."
msgstr "**Office-Integration:** Import, Export und Zusammenarbeit an Office-Dokumenten (Word, Excel, PDF)."

msgid "**Official packages only:** The image adds the Proxmox VE archive key from ``enterprise.proxmox.com``, verifies it against ``services.proxmox.ve.keyring_sha512``, adds the ``pve-no-subscription`` repository of ``download.proxmox.com`` and installs every package of ``services.proxmox.ve.packages`` at its pinned version. The build refuses an empty checksum or an unpinned package. There is no third-party image and no subscription workaround."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Official packages only:** The image adds the Proxmox VE archive key from `enterprise.proxmox.com`, verifies it against `services.proxmox.ve.keyring_sha512`, adds the `pve-no-subscription` repository of `download.proxmox.com` and installs every package of `services.proxmox.ve.packages` at its pinned version. The build refuses an empty checksum or an unpinned package. There is no third-party image and no subscription workaround."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Offline Python mint** at inventory build: ed25519 → address → exact Tor key-file formats → vault → `DOMAIN_PRIMARY`. Idempotent (existing key is reused, never regenerated). No Docker/Tor needed at build time."
msgstr "**Offline Python Mint** beim Inventaraufbau: ed25519 → Adresse → genau Tor Key-Dateiformate → Vault → `DOMAIN_PRIMARY`. Idempotent (bestehender Schlüssel wird wiederverwendet, niemals regeneriert). Kein Docker/Tor zur Bauzeit erforderlich."

msgid "**Offline deterministic minting:** the v3 key is generated without running Tor and the inventory pins its address (stable, backupable, restorable)."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Offline support:** Fully offline-capable for air-gapped deployments."
msgstr "**Offline Support:** Vollständig offline-fähig für Air-Gapped-Bereitstellungen."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Offline-tolerant:** no tag lookup at install time, so a DNS or API outage no longer breaks ``make install-lint``."
msgstr "**Offline-Tolerant:** kein Tag-Lookup bei Installationszeit, so dass ein DNS- oder API-Ausfall nicht mehr bricht ``make install-lint``."

