msgid "**Proxy-owned secret header:** the vhost sends a header named ``x-infinito-sso-proxy-<sso_proxy_secret>`` with every request, and ``gateway.auth.trustedProxy.requiredHeaders`` lists it next to ``x-forwarded-user``. A client that reaches the gateway port directly, including a process on the host that connects to the published port, cannot name that header, so the gateway answers its forged identity headers with 401. The gateway sends no failure reason to the client. ``files/test/test.sh`` asserts the refusal on the published port."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Proxy-owned secret header:** the vhost sends a header named `x-infinito-sso-proxy-<sso_proxy_secret>` with every request, and `gateway.auth.trustedProxy.requiredHeaders` lists it next to `x-forwarded-user`. A client that reaches the gateway port directly, including a process on the host that connects to the published port, cannot name that header, so the gateway answers its forged identity headers with 401. The gateway sends no failure reason to the client. `files/test/test.sh` asserts the refusal on the published port."
