msgid "**Redacted request path**: both access log formats write the path without query string, Referer or basic-auth user. Path segments after a password-reset, e-mail confirmation, e-mail login or account activation route (e.g. `/password/reset/`, `/confirm-email/`) are written as `[redacted]`; extend the `$infinito_access_log_path` map in [nginx.conf.j2](./templates/nginx.conf.j2) for further token routes."
