msgid "**Role Reconcile:** [files/ruby/reconcile_rbac.rb](./files/ruby/reconcile_rbac.rb) makes the members of the `administrator` role group GitLab administrators and the members of the `external` role group external users, and revokes both flags from every other human account except `root` and the platform administrator. It runs as a container hook of [sys-ctl-mtn-rbac-sync](../sys-ctl-mtn-rbac-sync/) at every deploy and on its timer, so a member who has not signed in yet gets the role on the first run after the first sign-in."
