msgid "**`shared_engine_isolation` (4):** `svc-db-memcached`, `svc-db-openldap`, `svc-db-postgres`, `svc-db-rabbitmq`. A generic endpoint would bypass application and tenant authorization on a shared engine. Any future exception requires a provider-application-specific account, namespace/database/schema/queue restriction, fixed named operations, and no engine administrator credential."
