msgid "A ``maxmemory`` ceiling derived from the service ``mem_limit`` with an ``allkeys-lru`` policy."
msgstr "A ``maxmemory`` Aus dem Dienst abgeleitete Obergrenze ``mem_limit`` mit einem ``allkeys-lru`` Politik."

msgid "A ``meta/services.yml`` entity that sets ``follow: <tag>`` only moves to a newer tag of the same shape whose digest equals the one ``<tag>`` points at. Ubuntu's ``latest`` names the newest LTS release and Fedora's the newest stable one, while the higher numbers (Ubuntu's interim releases, Fedora's rawhide) point elsewhere."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A ``mount --make-rshared /`` runs once in the deploy container before the runner starts, because MDAD’s systemd units bind-mount ``/matrix/synapse/storage`` with ``bind-propagation=slave``, which requires shared/slave propagation on the source."
msgstr "A ``mount --make-rshared /`` läuft einmal im Deployment-Container, bevor der Runner startet, weil die Systemd Units von MDAD bind-mount ``/matrix/synapse/storage`` mit ``bind-propagation=slave``, die Shared / Slave-Propagation auf der Quelle erfordert."

msgid "A ``pause`` outranks a ``start`` of the same tick, so the 07:00 end of the night window pauses the lane even where the day rule's first tick would start it, and the day rule takes over from its next tick."
msgstr ""

msgid "A ``source`` or ``when`` path names nothing in the inventory; the message never repeats the path."
