msgid "A deliberately vulnerable fixture app with seeded findings is the hacker's scenario target; its role fails hard when deployed by any inventory other than the agents bundle. The same app loads a web font from a third-party host and sets a cookie before consent, as the counsel's instance target. It carries a seeded weak test credential behind a seeded login throttle and lockout, so the hacker's credential brute forcing is exercised without a real account. It ships a known-vulnerable dependency, a missing security header and a weak TLS setting for the analysers to report."
msgstr ""

