msgid "A forward keeps the message in the account and sends a copy to every destination. The role writes the Sieve script ``infinito-forward`` (``redirect :copy``) into the account and activates it; a user script that was active is chained through ``include``, so personal filters keep working. Removing a forward from the inventory leaves the script in place; delete ``infinito-forward`` in the account’s filter settings to stop it. The role raises the user-script limits ``maxRedirects`` and ``maxOutMessages`` to the widest forward and reloads the settings; under SSO the restart of ```tasks/11_oidc_restart.yml`` <tasks/11_oidc_restart.yml>`__ applies them instead, because a reload opens the OIDC issuer and Keycloak deploys after Stalwart."
msgstr ""

msgid "A forward keeps the message in the account and sends a copy to every destination. The role writes the Sieve script `infinito-forward` (`redirect :copy`) into the account and activates it; a user script that was active is chained through `include`, so personal filters keep working. Removing a forward from the inventory leaves the script in place; delete `infinito-forward` in the account's filter settings to stop it. The role raises the user-script limits `maxRedirects` and `maxOutMessages` to the widest forward and reloads the settings; under SSO the restart of [`tasks/11_oidc_restart.yml`](tasks/11_oidc_restart.yml) applies them instead, because a reload opens the OIDC issuer and Keycloak deploys after Stalwart."
