msgid "A lightweight, Docker-powered UI framework that offers Infinito.Nexus users a unified interface to access all their applications in one intuitive dashboard. 🚀"
msgstr "Ein leichtes, Docker-basiertes UI-Framework, das bietet Infinito.Nexus Benutzer eine einheitliche Benutzeroberfläche, um auf alle ihre Anwendungen in einem intuitiven Dashboard zuzugreifen. 🚀"

msgid "A line counts when it is an added line (``+`` but not the ``+++`` header), carries a comment, and that comment is neither a shebang nor a nocheck/noqa directive nor a parameter doc."
msgstr ""

msgid "A link to the dashboard with the `#logout-everywhere` fragment. The dashboard uses only the user's own access token: it lists the user's applications through the Keycloak Account REST API, revokes the offline token of every application with offline access, ends every other session of the user, and then runs \"Log out on this device\"."
