msgid "An application id is expanded to the service key(s) that role provides; every other token is kept verbatim. Order-preserving, de-duplicated. Used wherever the operator supplies service references (``disable``, include/prune closures) so both spellings resolve identically."
msgstr "Eine Anwendungs-ID wird auf den Dienstschlüssel erweitert(s) Diese rolle bietet; jedes andere token wird wortwörtlich gehalten. Ordnung erhalten, dedupliziert. Wird verwendet, wenn der Betreiber Leistungsreferenzen liefert (``disable``, einschließlich Pflaumenverschlüsse) Beide Schreibweisen lösen sich also identisch auf."

msgid "An application registers its reconcile as a hook through [tasks/utils/rbac/sync.yml](../../tasks/utils/rbac/sync.yml). The util writes `hooks/<application_id>/` under `DIR_RBAC_SYNC`, root-only, with `hook.json`, the hook's script and the modules a host hook imports, and runs the hook once with the members the deploy resolved. The timer runs [files/python/script.py](./files/python/script.py) on `SYS_SCHEDULE_MAINTANANCE_RBAC_SYNC`; it reads the members of each hook's role groups anonymously from the directory and runs every hook whose container runs on the node."
msgstr ""

msgid "An application registers its reconcile as a hook through `tasks/utils/rbac/sync.yml <../../tasks/utils/rbac/sync.yml>`__. The util writes ``hooks/<application_id>/`` under ``DIR_RBAC_SYNC``, root-only, with ``hook.json``, the hook’s script and the modules a host hook imports, and runs the hook once with the members the deploy resolved. The timer runs `files/python/script.py <./files/python/script.py>`__ on ``SYS_SCHEDULE_MAINTANANCE_RBAC_SYNC``; it reads the members of each hook’s role groups anonymously from the directory and runs every hook whose container runs on the node."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "An application that declares no ``mem_limit`` for that service lets its container inherit the primary entity's, which is sized for the application and not for the engine beside it. The result is then capped at the same share of the provider's own limit. An application that declares the limit itself is not capped."
msgstr "Ein Antrag, der Nein erklärt ``mem_limit`` für diesen Dienst lässt seinen Container die primäre Entität erben, die für die Anwendung und nicht für den Motor neben ihr dimensioniert ist. Das Ergebnis wird dann auf den gleichen Anteil des eigenen Limits des Anbieters begrenzt. Eine Anwendung, die das Limit selbst deklariert, ist nicht gedeckelt."

msgid "An application that reads its roles from `realm_access.roles` instead of the groups claim sets `realm_roles: true` in its `meta/rbac.yml`. [10_realm_role_grants.yml](../../../../roles/web-app-keycloak/tasks/update/10_realm_role_grants.yml) then creates one realm role `<application_id>-<role>` per declared role, `administrator` included, and grants it to the matching group. Every realm user also holds `default-roles-<realm>`, which the application can map to its lowest role so that nobody without a role group is locked out."
