msgid "BookWyrm provides a federated social network for books built on ActivityPub. Each instance can be private, invitation-only, or open for public registration. Users can import/export book lists, interact with others across the Fediverse, and maintain their own curated reading environment. As an admin, you can configure moderation tools, content rules, and federation policies to suit your community."
