msgid "Gravatar is on (`gravatar_enabled` returns `true`): the top bar avatar loads from `https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/<hash>` (measured `naturalWidth` 80 from the Playwright container), so avatars break on an offline host and every page view sends the e-mail hash to a third party. Options: `gravatar: enabled: false` in `templates/config/gitlab.yml.j2` (fresh installs), or converge the application setting `gravatar_enabled`."
msgstr "Gravatar ist an (`gravatar_enabled` Rückgabe `true`): der obere Balken-Avatar lädt von `https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/<hash>` (gemessen `naturalWidth` 80 aus dem Playwright Container)So brechen Avatare auf einem Offline-Host und jede Seitenansicht sendet den E-Mail-Hash an einen Dritten. Optionen: `gravatar: enabled: false` in `templates/config/gitlab.yml.j2` (Neuinstallationen)oder die Anwendungseinstellung konvergieren `gravatar_enabled`."

