msgid "Integration tests that exercise custom Ansible action plugins end-to-end through real playbook runs (e.g. retry behavior of `uri` / `get_url` wrappers)."
msgstr "Integrationstests, die benutzerdefinierte Ansible-Action-Plugins Ende-zu-Ende durch echte Playbook-Läufe ausführen (z.B. Wiederholungsverhalten von `uri` / `get_url` Umschläge)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that pin the `meta/services.yml` ↔ `templates/playwright.env.j2` ↔ `files/playwright/playwright.spec.js` parity contract: every enabled service surfaces as `<NAME>_SERVICE_ENABLED=`, every env line is consumed by a gating helper in the spec, and `# nocheck: playwright-service-flag` / `# nocheck: playwright-service-gate` are the only suppressions."
msgstr "Integrationstests, die die `meta/services.yml` ↔ `templates/playwright.env.j2` ↔ `files/playwright/playwright.spec.js` Paritätsvertrag: alle aktivierten Serviceflächen als `<NAME>_SERVICE_ENABLED=`, jede env-Linie von einem Gating-Helfer in der Spezifikation verbraucht wird, und `# nocheck: playwright-service-flag` / `# nocheck: playwright-service-gate` Es sind die einzigen Unterdrückungen."

