# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover `meta/main.yml` presence and field shape. Tests about role dependencies declared in that file (`dependencies:`) MUST live under [`dependencies/`](dependencies/); checks tied to `meta/services.yml` MUST live under [`services/`](services/) (with the ordering-only `galaxy_info.run_after` checks under [`services/run_after/`](services/run_after/)); checks against `meta/variants.yml` MUST live under [`variants/`](variants/)."
msgstr "Tests in diesem Verzeichnis MÜSSEN nur abdecken `meta/main.yml` Präsenz und Feldform. Tests zu Rollenabhängigkeiten, die in dieser Datei deklariert sind (`dependencies:`) MUSS leben unter [`dependencies/`](dependencies/); Kontrollen gebunden an `meta/services.yml` MUSS leben unter [`services/`](services/) (Mit dem Ordering-only `galaxy_info.run_after` Kontrollen unter [`services/run_after/`](services/run_after/)); Kontrollen gegen `meta/variants.yml` MUSS leben unter [`variants/`](variants/)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover `meta/main.yml`'s `dependencies:` key. Checks tied specifically to `galaxy_info.run_after` (self-references, reference existence, run-after cycles) MUST live under [`../services/run_after/`](../services/run_after/). Generic structural role checks (folder names, presence of `meta/main.yml`, include target existence) MUST live two levels up under `tests/integration/roles/`."
msgstr "Tests in diesem Verzeichnis MÜSSEN nur abdecken `meta/main.yml`s `dependencies:` Schlüssel. Kontrollen speziell an `galaxy_info.run_after` (Selbstreferenzen, Referenzexistenz, Nachlaufzyklen) MUSS leben unter [`../services/run_after/`](../services/run_after/). Allgemeine strukturelle Rollenüberprüfungen (Ordnernamen, Vorhandensein von `meta/main.yml`, einschließlich Zielexistenz) MUSS zwei Levels up under `tests/integration/roles/`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover `meta/services.yml` shape and content. The ordering-only `galaxy_info.run_after` cluster lives in the [`run_after/`](run_after/) sub-cluster; coverage of `meta/variants.yml` lives one level up in [`../variants/`](../variants/); coverage of `meta/main.yml`'s `dependencies:` key lives in [`../dependencies/`](../dependencies/)."
msgstr "Tests in diesem Verzeichnis MÜSSEN nur abdecken `meta/services.yml` Form und Inhalt. Nur die Bestellung `galaxy_info.run_after` Cluster lebt im [`run_after/`](run_after/) Subcluster; Abdeckung von `meta/variants.yml` lebt eine Ebene nach oben in [`../variants/`](../variants/); Abdeckung von `meta/main.yml`s `dependencies:` Schlüsselleben in [`../dependencies/`](../dependencies/)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover `meta/variants.yml` shape and coverage. Coverage of `meta/services.yml` itself lives in [`../services/`](../services/); coverage of `meta/main.yml`'s `dependencies:` key lives in [`../dependencies/`](../dependencies/)."
msgstr "Tests in diesem Verzeichnis MÜSSEN nur abdecken `meta/variants.yml` Form und Abdeckung. Erfassung von `meta/services.yml` selbst lebt in [`../services/`](../services/); Abdeckung von `meta/main.yml`s `dependencies:` Schlüsselleben in [`../dependencies/`](../dependencies/)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover `run_after` semantics. Checks that target the `dependencies:` key MUST live in the sibling [`../../dependencies/`](../../dependencies/) cluster; broader `meta/services.yml` shape checks MUST live one level up in [`../`](../)."
msgstr "Tests in diesem Verzeichnis MÜSSEN nur abdecken `run_after` Semantik. Kontrollen, die auf die `dependencies:` Schlüssel muss in den Geschwistern leben [`../../dependencies/`](../../dependencies/) Cluster; breiter `meta/services.yml` Shape Checks MUST live one level up in [`../`](../)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover `run_once_*` flags and their lifecycle. Tests for generic fact overrides, task includes, or block structure MUST live elsewhere under `tests/integration/`."
msgstr "Tests in diesem Verzeichnis MÜSSEN nur abdecken `run_once_*` Flaggen und ihr Lebenszyklus. Tests auf generische Fakten außer Kraft setzen, Aufgabe beinhaltet oder Blockstruktur muss an anderer Stelle unter `tests/integration/`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover action plugins shipped under `plugins/action/` and their retry/error semantics. Tests that validate filter plugins, lookup plugins, or unrelated role logic MUST live elsewhere under `tests/integration/`."
msgstr "Tests in diesem Verzeichnis MÜSSEN nur Aktions-Plugins abdecken, die unter `plugins/action/` und ihre Retry/Error Semantik. Tests, die Filter-Plugins, Lookup-Plugins oder nicht verwandte Rollenlogik validieren, MÜSSEN an anderer Stelle unter `tests/integration/`."

