msgid "The ``s3.configure`` grant is required since SeaweedFS 4.39: a server started without an ``-s3.config`` has zero identities, and ListBuckets then returns an empty list to the consumer's access key, so the consumer reads the bucket as missing even though it exists. ``WriteAcp`` is required since SeaweedFS 4.49: a PutObject carrying ``x-amz-acl`` is also authorized as s3:PutObjectAcl and answers AccessDenied without it."
