# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "The `administrator` persona MUST drive at least one admin-only interaction (admin panel toggle, realm settings change, user-management surface, …). Specs supply this via the `adminInteraction` callback on `runAdminFlow(page, { adminInteraction })` under the same \"no generic default\" rule."
msgstr "Die `administrator` Persona MUSS mindestens eine Admin-Only-Interaktion (Admin-Panel-Toggle, Änderung der Realm-Einstellungen, Benutzerverwaltungsoberfläche, ...) steuern. Specs liefern dies über die `adminInteraction` Rückruf auf `runAdminFlow(page, { adminInteraction })` unter der gleichen \"no generic default\"-Regel."

msgid "The `administrator` persona is **not** blocked: [tasks/04_admin.yml](./tasks/04_admin.yml) seeds a native OpenProject account whose password is the Keycloak administrator secret, so the journey runs in every variant. The `biber` persona is blocked in every variant: biber holds no OpenProject role, so the oauth2-proxy gate and the LDAP `filter_string` refuse it. [test-rbac-gate.js](./files/playwright/test-rbac-gate.js) asserts that refusal, then adds biber to the `user` role group and drives the sign-in through the trusted-header bridge. Both flags are declared explicitly in [templates/playwright.env.j2](./templates/playwright.env.j2)."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `administrator` persona is additionally blocked because this role never creates a BookWyrm staff account. `files/sso/header_auth.py` provisions proxied identities with `create_user(...)` and no `is_staff` flag, and no task promotes an existing account, so the administrator arrives as an ordinary member with no admin surface to exercise."
msgstr "Die `administrator` Persona wird zusätzlich blockiert, da diese Rolle niemals ein BookWyrm-Mitarbeiterkonto erstellt. `files/sso/header_auth.py` Rückstellungen für Identitäten mit `create_user(...)` und nein `is_staff` Flag, und keine Aufgabe fördert ein bestehendes Konto, so dass der Administrator als gewöhnliches Mitglied ohne Administratoroberfläche ankommt."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `administrator` persona is blocked because Decidim's admin is a Devise account seeded by `files/ruby/ensure_admin_user.rb` and Devise signs in by e-mail address. The role's Playwright env therefore exposes `ADMIN_EMAIL` and no `ADMIN_USERNAME`, which is the variable the shared admin helper reads."
msgstr "Die `administrator` Persona ist blockiert, weil der Administrator von Decidim ein Devise-Konto ist, das von `files/ruby/ensure_admin_user.rb` Anmelden per E-Mail-Adresse. Das Playwright-Env der Rolle zeigt daher `ADMIN_EMAIL` und nein `ADMIN_USERNAME`, die die Variable ist, die der Shared Admin Helper liest."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `administrator` persona is blocked only while SSO is off. In that configuration `PROXY_HEADER_SSO` is false, so the trusted-header bridge is inactive and the sole account is the Django superuser bootstrapped by `tasks/01_manager_ops.yml` via `files/bootstrap_admin.py`, whose identifier is the ORM `username` rather than the e-mail Baserow's own sign-in form asks for. With SSO enabled the header bridge supplies the session and the persona runs."
msgstr "Die `administrator` Persona wird nur blockiert, während sso ausgeschaltet ist. In dieser Konfiguration `PROXY_HEADER_SSO` ist falsch, so dass die Trusted-Header-Bridge inaktiv ist und das einzige Konto der Django-Superuser ist, der von `tasks/01_manager_ops.yml` über `files/bootstrap_admin.py`, deren Kennung das ORM ist `username` anstatt das E-Mail-Anmeldeformular von Baserow anzufordern. Wenn SSO aktiviert ist, liefert die Header Bridge die Sitzung und die Persona läuft."

msgid "The `administrator` persona runs the role-local flow [`files/playwright/proxmox-flow.js`](./files/playwright/proxmox-flow.js): the OAuth2 proxy login, the OpenID realm login, the `Administrator` grant of its group on `/`, and the logout. [`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml) admits only the `web-app-proxmox` administrator RBAC group to the OAuth2 proxy (`sso.oauth2.allowed_groups`) and `biber` carries no roles, so [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) renders `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`. The `guest` persona and the baseline assertion run unconditionally."
msgstr ""

