msgid "The agent speaks the Anthropic Messages API, which the LiteLLM gateway serves alongside its OpenAI routes. The role writes the gateway URL, the workstation's key and the model aliases to `/usr/local/etc/claude-gateway.env` and installs the launcher `/usr/local/bin/claude-gateway`, which exports them and then starts `claude`. A session started with `claude-gateway` sends every request through the gateway, where it is accounted. Without managed connection settings, `claude` uses the user's own login, for example a subscription. Both share `~/.claude` with its memory, skills and projects."
