# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The generic playwright biber and administrator personas are blocked via `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true` in `templates/playwright.env.j2` (req 019 Rule 11 explicit opt-out). Bluesky's social-app is a mobile-first SPA whose logout / account control sits behind a profile menu the auth-surface check cannot reach. The bespoke \"OIDC: oauth2-proxy + login-broker drop a Bluesky session into social-app via Keycloak (variant A+)\" test and its LDAP-variant counterpart in `files/playwright/playwright.spec.js` already verify both personas authenticate correctly (BSKY_STORAGE.accessJwt is present after the broker handoff). Once a stable selector for the social-app profile menu lands upstream, drop the opt-outs and let the persona helpers drive the dashboard → app → logout journey end-to-end."
msgstr "Die generischen playwright biber und administrator personas sind blockiert über. `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` und `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true` in `templates/playwright.env.j2` (req 019 Rule 11 express opt-out). Blueskys Social-App ist ein Mobile-First-SPA, dessen Logout / Account-Steuerung hinter einem Profilmenü liegt, das der Auth-Surface-Check nicht erreichen kann. Der maßgeschneiderte \"OIDC: oauth2-proxy + login-broker drop a Bluesky session in social-app via Keycloak (Variante A+)\" Test und sein LDAP-Variante Pendant in `files/playwright/playwright.spec.js` bereits beide Personas korrekt authentifizieren ()BSKY_STORAGE.accessJwt ist nach der Broker-Handoff vorhanden. Sobald ein stabiler Selektor für das Social-App-Profilmenü stromaufwärts landet, lassen Sie die Opt-Outs fallen und lassen Sie die Persona-Helfer das Dashboard → App → Logout-Reise Ende-zu-Ende fahren."

