msgid "The rule of the classifier: a path it cannot model widens to the full set, never to nothing. Narrowing comes only from the rules that can prove it: a role path seeds its role, a format-only edit (same AST, same loaded YAML or JSON) reaches nothing, a test or a document runs no deploy, and a shared symbol (a plugin name, a module, a group_vars key) reaches the roles the symbol index finds consuming it. A role file adds every unit test that names the role, as a unit test reading the real roles tree does; a path that reaches the full set keeps the tests the walk found before it widened and its mirrored unit test."
