msgstr "Unter Schwarm, jede einzelne Rolle `driver: bridge` Das Netzwerk wird gerendert als `driver: overlay` mit `attachable: true`. Der knotenübergreifende Dienst-zu-Dienst-Verkehr hängt von Overlay-Netzwerken ab – Brückennetze sind knotenlokal und würden das Netz unterbrechen."

msgid "Under the ``mailbox`` email policy of ``web-app-keycloak``, the deploy applies the mailbox layout to every entry. It attaches ``infinitoMailboxUser``, keeps the current ``mail`` of an entry as its ``infinitoSecondaryMail`` when that address lies outside ``DOMAIN_PRIMARY`` and the entry holds no secondary address yet, and then sets ``mail`` to ``<uid>@<DOMAIN_PRIMARY>``. An entry without a kept address gets the inventory address as secondary address, which is seeded the same way, once."
msgstr ""

msgid "Under the `mailbox` email policy of `web-app-keycloak`, the deploy applies the mailbox layout to every entry. It attaches `infinitoMailboxUser`, keeps the current `mail` of an entry as its `infinitoSecondaryMail` when that address lies outside `DOMAIN_PRIMARY` and the entry holds no secondary address yet, and then sets `mail` to `<uid>@<DOMAIN_PRIMARY>`. An entry without a kept address gets the inventory address as secondary address, which is seeded the same way, once."
