msgid "[`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) renders `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true` in every matrix variant, because the shared persona helper cannot drive this role's sign-in in any of them. Three independent reasons, each sufficient on its own:"
msgstr "[`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) Putz `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` und `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true` in jeder Matrixvariante, weil der Shared Persona-Helfer die Anmeldung dieser Rolle in keiner von ihnen steuern kann. Drei unabhängige Gründe, von denen jeder für sich allein ausreicht:"

